# ---------------------------------------------------------------- CAD assets
# This repository ships the URDFs, not the geometry they reference — the CAD
# has no redistribution grant on file (LICENSE-STATUS.md) and lives in the
# private manipulation-kit-assets repository. `mkit-urdf fetch-assets` writes
# it HERE, so these lines are what stops a completed work tree from committing
# it back. Do not remove them without reading LICENSE-STATUS.md first.
src/manipulation_kit/description/d1/meshes/body/*.STL
src/manipulation_kit/description/d1/meshes/gripper/*.STL
src/manipulation_kit/description/d1_arm/left/meshes/*.STL
src/manipulation_kit/description/d1_arm/right/meshes/*.STL
src/manipulation_kit/hands/d1/parallel_gripper/descriptions/meshes/*.STL
# the optional decorative visual layer (`mkit-urdf fetch-visuals`)
src/manipulation_kit/description/d1/meshes/body_hifi/*.obj
